source: src/App.tsx
kind: module
purpose: Root component — uses flexlayout-react for a dockable multi-panel IDE layout. Renders MUI AppBar header with file name/loader and a camera-sync link/link-off IconButton, plus the flexlayout grid with retained viewer, sequence, interaction, DVBFixer, Homology, workspace, metadata, and settings panels. Supports adding panels via "+" button with MUI Menu. Activates useMolstarSync, useSequenceSync, and useCameraSync hooks.
